","portfolio-geometry/index.html":"<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><meta name="color-scheme" content="dark"><title>PerfectPower · Geometric Observatory</title><script>const p=location.pathname,b=document.createElement("base");b.href=p.endsWith("/")?p:p.endsWith(".html")?p.slice(0,p.lastIndexOf("/")+1):p+"/";document.head.append(b);</script><link rel="stylesheet" href="portfolio_geometry.css"><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#09121f;color:#e5eff6;font:16px/1.6 system-ui}header,main,footer{max-width:1400px;margin:auto;padding:24px}header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px}a{color:#89e4cb}h1{font-size:clamp(28px,5vw,48px);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-1px;margin:15px 0}p{color:#adc1d4}.lead{max-width:850px}.case-row{display:flex;align-items:end;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap}label{font-size:13px}select{display:block;padding:12px;margin-top:8px;background:#162a3b;color:#e4eef6;border:1px solid #3e586d;border-radius:10px;font:inherit}#geometry-status{color:#b9e4d9;font-size:13px;flex:1}footer{font-size:12px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.portfolio-geometry{margin-top:24px}@media(max-width:600px){header,main,footer{padding:16px}header{font-size:12px}}</style></head><body><header><strong>PerfectPower / Geometric Observatory</strong><a href="/portfolio">Explorer & downloads</a> <a href="/challenge/">Play the daily challenge</a></header><main><h1>Choose projects. Understand the tradeoffs.</h1><p class="lead">You have 50 projects and five resource budgets. Choosing a project adds a score and uses resources. Explore a previously calculated best portfolio here, then follow the three steps below. To change budgets and calculate your own choices, open Project portfolios in the Windows or Android Explorer.</p><div class="case-row"><label>Choose an example<select id="geometry-case"><option value="root">Start here: the best portfolio</option><option value="condi